#. むふふ、苗木誠殿は見所がある…
#. 実に見所がありますな…
msgctxt "0001 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Mwehehe... I see quality in you, Mr. Naegi.\n"
"True quality!"
msgstr ""

#. と・い・う・訳・で・だ！
msgctxt "0002 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "And that's why..."
msgstr ""

#. 拙者が苗木誠殿にレクチャーしてやるぞな。
#. <CLT 3>同人とは何か<CLT>という事についてね。
msgctxt "0003 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"...I've decided to present to you my lecture on <CLT 3>the\n"
"nature of fan fiction<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 僕の友人となるからには理解して貰いますぞ。
#. 同人に対する偏見は許しませんからね！
msgctxt "0004 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"If we're going to be friends, you must be fully\n"
"informed. I will permit no fanfic bigotry whatsoever!"
msgstr ""

#. 偏見なんてないよ…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't think I have any fanfic bigotry..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、ボクはあんまり詳しくないし…
#. その…オタク的な事に…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, I don't really know anything about that kind\n"
"of geeky stuff anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、来ましたよ…
#. 同人＝オタクですか…オタクの一言で終了ですか…
msgctxt "0007 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"See, there it is! To you, fanfic equals geeky, right?\n"
"But is that all that word is worth?"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　まずかった？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Did I say something wrong...?"
msgstr ""

#. いいですけどね。
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "But that's okay!"
msgstr ""

#. 僕は、オタクという言葉を褒め言葉として、
#. 捉えておりますから。
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Because I take the word geek as a compliment!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、オタクほど知識に富んでいる人間は
#. いないのですよ。
msgctxt "0011 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"For you see, there is nobody on Earth so full of\n"
"knowledge as a geek!"
msgstr ""

#. ある意味、専門家…
#. そう、エキスパートなのです。
msgctxt "0012 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"In a sense, a geek is like an expert. That's right, a\n"
"total expert!"
msgstr ""

#. ミュージシャンだって、音楽オタクだし、
#. 映画監督だって、映画オタクでしょう？
msgctxt "0013 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"A successful musician must necessarily be a music\n"
"geek, a good movie director is a movie geek. You see?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、そういう専門家達が、
#. 世界を切り開いてきたのですよ。
msgctxt "0014 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It's those experts, those *geeks* who open up the\n"
"world to others!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、同人と言っただけで、
#. オタクと連想されるという事は…
msgctxt "0015 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "So when you say that writing fanfic is \"geeky\"..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクらは、そういう専門家として
#. 認知されているという事なのであります！
msgctxt "0016 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...you're recognizing us as true experts!"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ…
#. そもそもさ、同人ってどういう意味なの？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, so um...what exactly *is* fanfic, then?"
msgstr ""

#. …おふっ！
#. 俗に言うストレートな質問キタコレですね！
msgctxt "0018 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Oof! Super direct question FTW!"
msgstr ""

#. 広い意味では、同人誌即売会やショップなどで…
msgctxt "0019 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Basically, we have all different kinds of stores and\n"
"events, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分で描いたアニメやマンガやゲームに関する
#. 作品などを公開する、聖なる闘士達です。
msgctxt "0020 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"These are where groups of holy warriors sell their\n"
"own stuff based on games, comics, anime, everything."
msgstr ""

#. その同人って人達の作るのが…同人誌だよね？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And the stuff those people make...is fanfic?"
msgstr ""

#. 書籍に限らず、ソフトウェアや音楽ＣＤ、
#. グッズのような立体物なども作りますがね！
msgctxt "0022 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Comics are the most common creation, but it also\n"
"includes games, music, and even merchandise!"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、その同人達の集まりを
#. なんと称すかご存知ですか？
msgctxt "0023 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"By the way, there's a name for when a group of fanfic\n"
"creators come together."
msgstr ""

#. 同人誌などの発行主体の事ですよ。
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Specifically, it's any organized group that comes\n"
"together to release their work."
msgstr ""

#. サークル
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Circle"
msgstr ""

#. クラブ
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Square"
msgstr ""

#. クラブ、じゃなかったかな？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it...a square?"
msgstr ""

#. むむむむっ！
#. 確かに、そのように名乗る人々もおりますな…
msgctxt "0028 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Ng-gh-gh-gh! Certainly there may be *others* who call\n"
"us square..."
msgstr ""

#. しかし、もっと浸透した単語があるのですよ…
#. 苗木誠殿もご存じの、例の単語ですよ…？
msgctxt "0029 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But among our own kind, there's a more...accepted\n"
"term. Surely you must know..."
msgstr ""

#. 同好会
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Menagerie"
msgstr ""

#. 同好会、じゃない？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it...a menagerie...?"
msgstr ""

#. そうですなぁ…
#. それも間違いではありませんな。
msgctxt "0032 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Well...I suppose on a technical linguistic level,\n"
"that's true."
msgstr ""

#. それをあえて英語で言ってみると…？
msgctxt "0033 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "But I'm talking about something a little more common."
msgstr ""

#. さあ、これでもうおわかりのはず…
#. 答えてみんしゃい！
msgctxt "0034 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Listen, I'm sure you know this. Go ahead and tell me!"
msgstr ""

#. およよッ！
#. なんと、答えられないとは予想外！
msgctxt "0035 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Hey, come on! I can't believe you refuse to answer!"
msgstr ""

#. 先生、間違っていても怒ったりしませんよ？
#. ほら？　答えてごらん？
msgctxt "0036 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"You're not gonna make the teacher mad if you get it\n"
"wrong. Just give it your best shot!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>同人誌なんかの発行主体…
#. ええっと、確か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A group that comes together to release their work...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. サークル…って呼ぶんじゃなかった？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is it...a circle?"
msgstr ""

#. 当然ですな！　知ってて当然ですな！
#. 世界の常識ですから！
msgctxt "0039 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"It sure is! Of course you knew that. I mean, it's only\n"
"common sense!"
msgstr ""

#. …って、そんな常識的な事を
#. イチイチ説明させないでください！
msgctxt "0040 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I certainly hope you don't expect me to explain such\n"
"common-sense topics every time!"
msgstr ""

#. だから言ったじゃん…
#. あんまり詳しくないって…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, like I said...I don't know too much about this\n"
"stuff."
msgstr ""

#. 詳しくないってレベルじゃありませんな！
msgctxt "0042 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "This goes well beyond \"I don't know too much\"!"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ…ですが仕方ありません。
#. そんな常識の布教も、同人界を代表する僕の務め…
msgctxt "0043 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"But I guess I can't blame you. The propaganda never\n"
"touches on that, so as a fanfic ambassador..."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、ここでの生活を終える頃には、
#. 苗木誠殿も一般参加者として即売会に来場するという…
msgctxt "0044 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"By the time I'm done with you, you'll be itching to\n"
"buy a premium pass to the next fanfic con!"
msgstr ""

#. ねっ！？
msgctxt "0045 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Right!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ねっ…って明るく言われても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously *he's* excited, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ぐふふ…これからも同人についてレクチャーしますぞ。
msgctxt "0047 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Gwehehe... That's it for today. I hope you're excited\n"
"for your next lesson!"
msgstr ""

#. 先が楽しみですな…
msgctxt "0048 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"I can't wait to see what the future has in store for\n"
"the two of us..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>先が思いやられるよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm kinda scared to see what the future has in store\n"
"for the two of us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>山田一二三の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hifumi's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“クラフトワーク”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Handiwork<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは山田クンと別れると、
#. いったん、自分の部屋へと戻る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After we were done, I decided to head back to my room\n"
"for a while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
